# Everything under dist/ is uploaded verbatim by `wrangler deploy`, including
# dotfiles, so anything non-content that reaches the build output would be
# published at qyl.at. Finder metadata leaks local folder and window state;
# scripts/check-artifacts.mjs writes its budget evidence outside dist/ for the
# same reason, and fails the build if either ever reappears in the upload.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
evidence/
